# MASCI Operations Platform — .gitignore
# Locked 2026-08-04 (Track 20.9 cleanup). Previous file had grown to
# 862 lines of duplicated `credentials.json` blocks and thousands of
# leaked webpack cache pack filenames (`frontend/node_modules/.cache/
# default-development/N.pack`). This rewrite:
#   • preserves every secret protection line (env + credential + pem),
#   • preserves the Track 15.80 secret-file pattern lock,
#   • preserves the sensitive test-credentials guard
#     (`memory/test_credentials.md`),
#   • preserves the walkthrough_reports editorial-artifact rule,
#   • folds all of `frontend/node_modules/.cache/**` and
#     `backend/backups/**` under wildcard rules instead of listing
#     individual filenames, and
#   • removes the sh-heredoc-leakage `-e` fragments.
#
# Any future addition to this file MUST retain the "Secrets" and
# "Track 15.80 secret pattern lock" sections. The regression test
# `backend/tests/test_track_15_80_no_secrets_in_repo.py` enforces the
# secret-scan side of this file.

# ── IDEs / editors ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Dependencies / package managers ───────────────────────────────
node_modules/
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/install-state.gz
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# ── Testing / coverage ────────────────────────────────────────────
/coverage
.pytest_cache/

# ── Next.js ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.next/
/out/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Production builds ────────────────────────────────────────────
/build
dist/
dist

# ── Logs / debug ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
dump.rdb
*.log
/var/log/

# ── System files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
venv/
.venv/

# ── Development tools ────────────────────────────────────────────
chainlit.md
.chainlit
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.ac

# ── Deployment platforms ─────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel

# ── Data / archives / large binaries ─────────────────────────────
agenthub/agents/youtube/db
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tar
**/*.tgz
*.pack
*.pack_
*.deb
*.dylib

# ── Build caches ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
frontend/node_modules/.cache/**
frontend/node_modules/.cache

# ── Backups (auto-generated · never commit) ──────────────────────
backend/backups/**
backend/storage/**

# ── Emergent walkthrough / editorial artifacts (not source) ──────
walkthrough_reports/

# ── SECRETS — DO NOT REMOVE ANY LINE BELOW ───────────────────────
# Environment files (all shapes)
.env
.env.*
*.env
env.local

# Credential files
credentials.json
*credentials.json*
*token.json*
.credentials
.secrets/

# Certificate / key material
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Sensitive test credentials (checked at deploy time)
memory/test_credentials.md

# TRACK 15.80 — secret-file pattern lock. Block historical class of
# files that have leaked production secrets into git (e.g.
# PRODUCTION_SECRETS_SEALED.env.template). Never commit anything
# matching these patterns; the secret-scanner regression test
# `backend/tests/test_track_15_80_no_secrets_in_repo.py` enforces
# this on every CI run.
*.env.template
*_SECRETS_*.env*
*_SECRETS_*.template
*SEALED*.env*
*SEALED*.template
secrets.env*
secret_rotation_evidence_*.txt
backend/storage/project_docs/24-12/0d0e9933-cfa6-4efc-a790-ce6469ae188a.pdf
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/49.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/6.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/13.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/3.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/0.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/43.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/4.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/4.pack
frontend/node_modules/.cache/

# ── Generated local evidence / temp artifacts ─────────────────────
deploy_reports/
test_reports/
tmp_real_photos/
walkthrough_reports/
*.bak
*.backup
*.old

# ── Platform-local preview metadata ───────────────────────────────
.emergent/cron/applied.hash
.emergent/cron/webhook-crons
.emergent/emergent.yml

